#: fe83bad1ec7640a880668b153aa28ab2
msgid "Consumer Grade Power System for Small Quadcopters (8\" - 12\" Propellers)"
msgstr "小型四旋翼消费级动力系统（8 至 12 英寸螺旋桨）"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:452
#: 017c8e80fab145b6bf7fb35913a1d649
msgid ""
"Here is a durable and low cost alternative for powering smaller hobby or "
"even semi-pro sub 5 pound Quadcopters."
msgstr "以下是一款为小型爱好级甚至半专业级 5 磅以内四旋翼提供动力的耐用且低成本替代方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:455
#: 7ea8173c12e14a2ca33200d06f5a0e35
msgid ""
"The `DJI 2212 Motors <http://www.ebay.com/itm/like/231128616387?lpid=82>`__ "
"provided with their low cost ARF Flamewheel Quadcopters are unusually "
"durable and cost $24.00 each."
msgstr ""
"DJI Flamewheel 低成本 ARF 四旋翼飞行器附带的 `DJI 2212 电机 "
"<http://www.ebay.com/itm/like/231128616387?lpid=82>`__ 耐用性出众，售价 24.00 美元每个。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:457
#: 87fe38b521fd457c82e5940adc18ccda
msgid ""
"And DJI's specially hubbed 10\" plastic props at $8.00 a pair are well "
"balanced, efficient and rugged."
msgstr "DJI 特制毂孔 10 英寸塑料螺旋桨每对售价 8.00 美元，平衡优良、效率高且坚固耐用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:466
#: c00d9edc8e524499a209990434e296c9
msgid ""
"And this easy to use $40.00 four in one ESC eliminates a power distribution "
"board, reduces EMF and provides good reliability."
msgstr "这款易于使用、售价 40.00 美元的四合一 ESC 消除了电源分配板的需求，降低了 EMF 干扰并提供了良好的可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:473
#: 5be1284528c74b2ead039521347cd56d
msgid ""
"For $150.00 you can actually get quite a useful and durable power system for"
" a smaller sub five pound quadcopter."
msgstr "花费 150.00 美元，您实际上可以为 5 磅以内的小型四旋翼获得相当实用且耐用的动力系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:477
#: 0678a8355e434e99b3fb74b9dc42c668
msgid ""
"The $40.00 SunnySky X4108S pancake motor is also capable of being used on "
"Quadcopters lifting up to 10 pounds."
msgstr "售价 40.00 美元的 SunnySky X4108S 扁平电机同样能够用于举升最高 10 磅的四旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:479
#: a305dce52df64fb5907bd959d4aa2f25
msgid ""
"It is well regarded, efficient and durable and is suitable for use with 14\""
" or 15\" propellers and 4 cell to 6 cell LiPo batteries."
msgstr "它备受好评、效率高且耐用，适合搭配 14 或 15 英寸螺旋桨以及 4 节至 6 节锂聚合物电池使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:484
#: f003807c15c1426bb60206dea8633b16
msgid "Clearly these are not the only alternatives."
msgstr "当然，这些并不是唯一的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:486
#: fa753bc93afc43a5812954af2b5a8f46
msgid ""
"If you want to use your copter for constant, professional use you will want "
"something like the first 3 configurations."
msgstr "如果您想将飞行器用于持续的专业用途，您需要类似前 3 种配置的产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:487
#: 7c17e5e43f074a53b4b62d65fb86203b
msgid ""
"For occasional, hobby or non-critical use for flying, FPV and / or personal "
"video or photography the others should be OK."
msgstr "对于偶尔的爱好飞行、非关键性飞行、FPV 和/或个人视频或摄影用途，其他配置应该足够了。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:488
#: cadee23087eb425193c816d2c3df6783
msgid ""
"The KDE and Pro T-Motors bearings will last longer and are more weather "
"proof and reliable than the less expensive alternatives."
msgstr "KDE 和 Pro T-Motor 的轴承使用寿命更长，防水性和可靠性优于低价替代品。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:489
#: 53f500c4c9b34b69923d6f8623930717
msgid ""
"And the more expensive Carbon Fiber props are more efficient, better "
"balanced and more durable than cheaper alternatives."
msgstr "较贵的碳纤维螺旋桨效率更高、平衡性更好，比廉价替代品更耐用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:490
#: 86e0db0598c24207969d57e1d3fc00be
msgid ""
"But properly installed on an appropriate copter the less expensive "
"alternatives listed can provide many reliable hours of flying."
msgstr "但在适当的飞行器上正确安装后，所列出的低价替代品可以提供许多可靠的飞行小时数。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:491
#: 9c6bcf37b2cc4b32ad22b8102676d2cf
msgid ""
"I have favored slow speed pancake motors because efficiency and flight time "
"benefit from the larger propellers they can use."
msgstr "我偏向于低转速扁平电机，因为它们能使用更大的螺旋桨，从而提升效率和飞行时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:493
#: 40eb5aa8c3544ee08eaa84ab60ed367b
msgid ""
"The above illustrates just some of the possibilities in identifying an "
"appropriate power system for your project."
msgstr "上述内容仅举例说明了为您的项目确定合适动力系统的部分可能性。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:496
#: 99689690852a440bb3d5939a1cfde586
msgid "The MultiCopter Frame"
msgstr "多旋翼机架"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:498
#: c01c30c15d014131a97ed4ae80e4bfb7
msgid ""
"There are many types of frames and it is most important to put together a "
"frame that is appropriate for your use."
msgstr "机架种类繁多，最重要的是组装一个适合您用途的机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:500
#: d82c6e4b708a4fd5b1f635fd91c3e457
msgid ""
"There are a lot of Multicopter frame types and many are available as bare "
"frame kits or Almost Ready To Fly or Ready To Fly copters."
msgstr "多旋翼机架类型众多，许多以裸机架套件、准成品（ARF）或即飞型（RTF）飞行器的形式供货。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:502
#: ef8797fb03f24786b5698df5f22cc2c4
msgid ""
"Most professional grade Multicopters are made from fiberglass and carbon "
"fiber cut tubing and plate."
msgstr "大多数专业级多旋翼由玻璃纤维和碳纤维切割管材及板材制成。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:504
#: 0da9230fa8384ca18ad9cf90004ee76c
msgid ""
"Carbon fiber is very strong, but is also brittle and can shatter on impact, "
"it is also hard to machine and to glue to."
msgstr "碳纤维非常坚固，但也很脆，受到撞击时可能碎裂，且难以机加工和粘接。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:506
#: 91c5918e2b7c4385a470e4bf264c18f7
msgid ""
"Fiberglass weighs a bit more for equivalent strength but is more shatter "
"resistant and easier to machine and glue to."
msgstr "玻璃纤维在同等强度下重量略重，但抗碎裂性更好，也更易于机加工和粘接。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:508
#: cc4dc568c42e4e0e8465728806600948
msgid ""
"Fiberglass or carbon fiber tube and sheet construction are very suitable to "
"use for making your own copters."
msgstr "玻璃纤维或碳纤维管材和板材结构非常适合用于自制飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:511
#: de54ccfe08e54ae7ad6a3162006e2e01
msgid ""
"Many consumer grade Multicopters are made with injection molded plastic "
"parts and aluminum tubing."
msgstr "许多消费级多旋翼由注塑塑料零件和铝管制成。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:514
#: a0352367de344a9d9e86f9f8faace594
msgid ""
"Some injection molded parts can be very durable (the Iris's Zytel frame arms"
" for instance), but others are cheap and break easily."
msgstr "一些注塑零件可能非常耐用（例如 Iris 的 Zytel 机架臂），但也有一些很廉价，容易折断。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:517
#: 406fc12407644962b8604002a97699dd
msgid ""
"Square aluminum tubing frame arms are common, but they tend to bend or break"
" with annoying frequency in normal mishaps."
msgstr "方形铝管机架臂很常见，但在日常意外中，它们往往以令人恼火的频率弯曲或断裂。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:519
#: 7eeaa65e4167458d8b0371fd50b25e64
msgid ""
"Except in specialized welded H or box frames aluminum tubing frame arms are "
"sub optimal and will not be covered in depth here."
msgstr "除了专用焊接 H 型或箱型机架外，铝管机架臂并非最优选择，本文不作深入介绍。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:523
#: 14066df8246c4d7ab4eadbf034a261e9
msgid ""
"Some of the newer, smaller, commercially made Quadcopters have monolithic "
"injection molded plastic shells."
msgstr "一些较新的、较小的商用四轴飞行器采用整体注塑成型的塑料外壳。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:526
#: 8349c34fb7ba4b4398b52d65121bd435
msgid ""
"On smaller copters these shells can be quite durable but they would be too "
"fragile on larger ones even if mold costs were justified."
msgstr "在较小的飞行器上，这些外壳可以相当耐用，但在较大的飞行器上即使模具成本合理，它们也会过于脆弱。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:530
#: c19084a9affe4eaaacaaf59843a3980f
msgid ""
"A few Quadcopters have monolithic shells made from vacuum formed laminated "
"Kydex or other plastic sheet"
msgstr "少数四轴飞行器采用真空成型的叠层Kydex或其他塑料板制成的整体外壳。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:533
#: 51e793d07ae84cd59409ba0e9f1a5a14
msgid ""
"Vacuum formed shells of laminated Kydex have proven very durable on small "
"copters and are very good for waterproof uses."
msgstr "叠层Kydex真空成型外壳在小型飞行器上被证明非常耐用，非常适合防水用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:535
#: c563f76e2b7b4d5da743dbb250717264
msgid ""
"At least one vacuum formed copter has been made with built in blade guards "
"the Safe Flight 4410 (unfortunately out of business)."
msgstr "至少有一款真空成型飞行器内置了螺旋桨护罩——Safe Flight 4410（遗憾的是该公司已倒闭）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:539
#: f1979e1d128b4273b5441e218728c95b
msgid ""
"Hand laid fiberglass or carbon fiber is also popular on high end "
"quadcopters."
msgstr "手工铺制的玻璃纤维或碳纤维在高端四轴飞行器中也很流行。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:542
#: de6ea742384b40eaa766f0db4b55945c
msgid ""
"There are some very attractive, hard to get and not inexpensive hand laid "
"fiberglass and carbon fiber shells made by \"DeX\"."
msgstr "\"DeX\"制造了一些非常吸引人、难以获得且价格不菲的手工铺制玻璃纤维和碳纤维外壳。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:544
#: 37963f0dc548463da9b7b6fbde7c8b88
msgid ""
"There are also a variety of fiberglass shells for civilian, commercial and "
"military use including an amphibious one."
msgstr "还有各种用于民用、商用和军用的玻璃纤维外壳，包括一款水陆两用型。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:546
#: b5e4ed686d404b06ada0d16e8edcc2f2
msgid ""
"Fiberglass shells tend to be expensive and may get damaged in use and can be"
" difficult to repair."
msgstr "玻璃纤维外壳往往价格昂贵，使用中可能受损，且难以修复。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:549
#: c9bd41c81b094f98a4b67399543996d4
msgid ""
"Each type of construction has advantages and disadvantages and it is very "
"important to figure out what is important for your needs."
msgstr "每种构造类型都有优缺点，弄清楚什么对您的需求最为重要非常关键。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:551
#: 96ca9196bef34cae93d8bf72996cec80
msgid ""
"Prop to prop and prop to frame clearance limit the max diameter of your "
"propeller blades."
msgstr "螺旋桨之间以及螺旋桨与机架之间的间距限制了桨叶的最大直径。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:554
#: d0ce1b63f11241be86440caabb9d5c01
msgid ""
"Allowing for various prop diameters will let you tune the copter for its "
"current weight, batteries and function.."
msgstr "为各种螺旋桨直径留有余量，可以让您根据当前重量、电池和用途对飞行器进行调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:556
#: 721d0f164b634161a423dc5d600f9c15
msgid ""
"Generally allow an additional half inch of clearance from prop tip to tip or"
" to center frame to avoid asymmetrical prop wash vibration."
msgstr "通常应在桨尖到桨尖或桨尖到中心机架之间额外留出半英寸的间距，以避免不对称桨洗震动。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:559
#: b618021163484b0a926fe2d3ca1282e5
msgid ""
"A major design criteria is to size the frame appropriately for the largest "
"propellers you might ever want to use."
msgstr "一个主要的设计标准是将机架尺寸适配为您可能希望使用的最大螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:561
#: 71d3a91f06d54f76a814f59b2c1887f2
msgid ""
"Generally bigger propeller diameter equals better efficiency and an X frame "
"layout normally permits the largest possible props."
msgstr "通常螺旋桨直径越大效率越高，X型机架布局通常允许使用尽可能大的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:564
#: 88a9ac57c8114819a8e2ed5bb5c0b3be
msgid ""
"Of course the motor speed and power and frame strength have to be matched to"
" the propeller diameter and to total lifting capacity."
msgstr "当然，电机转速和功率以及机架强度必须与螺旋桨直径和总升力相匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:567
#: d479fb81a69943f39d78e4c992b870e0
msgid "Pancake Low KV, Low RPM motors can turn bigger propellers efficiently."
msgstr "扁平低KV、低转速电机可以高效驱动更大的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:569
#: 1117759338ff4f29b7086b5529e9cc68
msgid ""
"It is possible to overlap prop tips if you have one above the other, but it "
"does affect efficiency and induces asymmetric vibration."
msgstr "如果一个螺旋桨在另一个上方，桨尖可以重叠，但这会影响效率并导致非对称震动。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:572
#: 3cad99a97ae644faae637abccf51e4ef
msgid ""
"Big slow props can have adverse vibration, instability, gust compensation "
"and response rate issues also so that is a downside."
msgstr "大而慢速的螺旋桨也可能带来不利的震动、不稳定、阵风补偿和响应速率问题，这是其缺点。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:576
#: 91367c30b7574f4c88e558d6d9dc3b53
msgid ""
"The additional motors of Hex and Octocopters can permit single motor out "
"recovery and provide for smoother flight for photo uses."
msgstr "六轴和八轴飞行器的额外电机可以实现单电机故障恢复，并为航拍提供更平稳的飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:579
#: 9bb0321fed7c40f7ab13f81b249214d7
msgid ""
"But they need to use smaller propellers because of motor to motor clearance "
"which is less efficient resulting in shorter flight times."
msgstr "但由于电机间距的限制，它们需要使用更小的螺旋桨，效率更低，导致飞行时间更短。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:582
#: ba40780f74994828b3bfa464837a1b81
msgid ""
"There is also additional cost and weight of the frames and extra motors and "
"propellers."
msgstr "机架、额外电机和螺旋桨的成本和重量也会增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:584
#: aed3c458f5934b0289a2574ce67847e8
msgid "And, the overall increase in complexity also reduces reliability."
msgstr "而且，整体复杂性的增加也会降低可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:586
#: aa924e3da3a44662912ae5bc65535f09
msgid ""
"High quality extended service larger pancake motors and props are just "
"starting to become available."
msgstr "高质量的长寿命大型扁平电机和螺旋桨正开始逐渐上市。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:588
#: 175192cb450242b98f7af16e583fcd3a
msgid ""
"So we are likely to see a shift to large Quadcopters from Hexacopters and "
"Octocopters even for professional and commercial uses."
msgstr "因此，即使在专业和商业用途上，我们也可能看到从六轴和八轴飞行器向大型四轴飞行器的转变。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:593
#: 73394ca41b43427589df9a2ddae4c351
msgid "The Carbon Fiber or Fiberglass Tube and Plate Frame"
msgstr "碳纤维或玻璃纤维管板机架"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:595
#: fc7b0a6e8a6b47e7b0fffd42f99441c7
msgid ""
"The carbon fiber or fiberglass tube and plate frame is popular because it is"
" strong and light and easily manufactured."
msgstr "碳纤维或玻璃纤维管板机架因其强度高、重量轻且易于制造而广受欢迎。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:598
#: 70e1a856e27e48978bfe36625b6f206e
msgid ""
"The `Tarot 650 <http://www.helipal.com/tarot-fy650-quadricopter-frame-"
"set.html>`__ is a typical layout medium sized carbon fiber Quadcopter frame "
"that can work with up to 17\" propellers."
msgstr ""
"`Tarot 650 <http://www.helipal.com/tarot-fy650-quadricopter-frame-"
"set.html>`__ 是一款典型的中等尺寸碳纤维四轴飞行器机架，可支持最大17英寸的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:602
#: bce01b39e53b4faead2305291a8c0681
msgid "It features folding arms and landing gear."
msgstr "它具有可折叠机臂和起落架。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:603
#: 08fa66073c05490aac032793e056178c
msgid ""
"Its ability to support pancake motors and 17\" props means it can provide "
"long flight times."
msgstr "其支持扁平电机和17英寸螺旋桨的能力意味着它可以提供较长的飞行时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:605
#: dba3eb76ee5f42d7861a4d502706cf83
msgid ""
"Some people have said the quality of construction is not as good as it could"
" be but for $125.00 it is an amazing bargain."
msgstr "有些人说其制造质量不如预期，但以125美元的价格来说，它是非常物超所值的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:611
#: 3d4c961a2e824c7e9f6459d994e87422
msgid ""
"Fabrication requirements and techniques for fiberglass and carbon fiber tube"
" and plate copters."
msgstr "玻璃纤维和碳纤维管板飞行器的制作要求和技术。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:613
#: 3288714e48f84940927901eeccf89ce7
msgid ""
"On the copters shown above the method of attachment is by clamping carbon "
"fiber tube frame arms with aluminum brackets."
msgstr "在上面展示的飞行器中，连接方式是用铝制支架夹紧碳纤维管机架臂。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:616
#: 5822b4c9eb8446ea8054179476d0897b
msgid ""
"This is because of the difficulties in attaching carbon fiber parts as well "
"as the stress that can result from drilling the tubing."
msgstr "这是因为碳纤维零件连接困难，以及钻孔可能产生的应力问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:619
#: 0c25b21b83f24c0eb5f02a6be04ea061
msgid ""
"Fiberglass is not quite as strong or light as carbon fiber but it is more "
"flexible and easier to join and machine."
msgstr "玻璃纤维不如碳纤维强或轻，但更灵活，更容易连接和加工。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:622
#: 117818ee80e04c1388071cc6feae438f
msgid ""
"If what you need is available in a commercial frame kit you are normally "
"better off buying it as you will spend more making your own."
msgstr "如果您需要的东西在商用机架套件中有售，通常购买会更合算，因为自制会花费更多。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:625
#: 66d11cef05904cb5b21790c33332134c
msgid ""
"It will also take a lot of time and effort to design the copter, to obtain "
"the components and to, cut, drill, machine and fabricate them."
msgstr "设计飞行器、获取零部件、切割、钻孔、加工和制作也需要大量时间和精力。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:628
#: 130cad07439b4b57952cd1d63ecc04ba
msgid ""
"There is also a strong possibility that design and fabrication mistakes and "
"misperceptions will require that some things get redone."
msgstr "设计和制造中的错误和误判很可能导致部分工作需要返工。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:632
#: 2e56d8747e1c420a9ddca118b6969c0b
msgid ""
"If you have sufficient reason to make your own frame, tube and plate "
"construction is generally the most practical for home production."
msgstr "如果您有充分的理由自制机架，管板结构通常是家庭生产中最实用的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:634
#: 0f8c005007cd4770a4d4e3f304d2d8f1
msgid ""
"It is reasonable to mix materials, commonly carbon fiber frame tubes and "
"fiberglass central and motor mounting plates."
msgstr "可以合理地混合使用材料，通常是碳纤维管机架臂和玻璃纤维中央及电机安装板。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:637
#: e31a08404d3f4a0fa6a5b2efcd6ae444
msgid ""
"Carbon fiber and fiberglass tubing and plate can be cut with a hacksaw or "
"power jig or band saw (with metal or fiberglass blades)."
msgstr "碳纤维和玻璃纤维管材及板材可以用钢锯、电动线锯或带锯（使用金属或玻璃纤维锯片）切割。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:641
#: 832962a98b634c9da2879a576bab19e1
msgid ""
"It can also be drilled and milled with HSS or TC coated drills and mills, "
"but all tooling wears out very quickly cutting these materials."
msgstr "也可以用高速钢或碳化钛涂层钻头和铣刀进行钻孔和铣削，但所有刀具在切割这些材料时磨损非常快。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:645
#: 17a7fe7df8fe414cb195985909c91b25
msgid ""
"Carbon fiber in particular is tricky to cut, drill and machine, it can tear,"
" shatter or de-laminate if not done smoothly and slowly."
msgstr "碳纤维尤其难以切割、钻孔和加工，如果操作不平稳缓慢，可能会撕裂、碎裂或分层。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:648
#: d1f4512f907a41368426a7805d2be9fa
msgid ""
"A drill press is mandatory for carbon fiber, you cant center punch a pilot "
"drill hole, so it needs to be held precisely in place."
msgstr "加工碳纤维必须使用台钻，因为无法打中心冲点引导钻孔，所以需要精确固定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:651
#: b54c1f2ff8ee49249fbd93930508850d
msgid ""
"Avoid milling of carbon fiber if at all possible, it is very difficult to "
"accomplish satisfactory results."
msgstr "尽量避免对碳纤维进行铣削，很难取得令人满意的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:653
#: e8616c31898c4cc99901888a67d3d121
msgid ""
"You will see carbon fiber plates that have milled slots on consumer copters "
"but these have generally been cut with a water jet."
msgstr "您会看到消费级飞行器上的碳纤维板有铣槽，但这些通常是用水刀切割的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:656
#: e2af492b68ee44f5ad0ae57c570a00ab
msgid ""
"With carbon fiber you will generally get better results drilling precision "
"placed holes rather than attempting to mill slots in it."
msgstr "对于碳纤维，通常在精确定位处钻孔比尝试铣槽能获得更好的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:659
#: 1018b00a6de0466cb45f16b31d407cce
msgid ""
"You can carefully and slowly cut a carbon fiber plates exterior edges with a"
" power saw and smooth them with a Dremel tool."
msgstr "您可以用电锯小心缓慢地切割碳纤维板的外边缘，并用Dremel工具将其打磨光滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:661
#: 3d5a4d9219654b999da88a7b5379ba05
msgid ""
"If you must put in slots consider drilling a hole at each end and using a "
"small circular saw on a Dremel or flex shaft to connect them."
msgstr "如果必须开槽，可以考虑在两端各钻一个孔，然后用Dremel或软轴上的小型圆锯片将两孔连通。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:665
#: 13975a2540cc49efb2ebe0888d4eb8b1
msgid ""
"It will be necessary to provide appropriate brackets to clamp the motor "
"mounts and central hub to the frame arm tubes."
msgstr "需要提供适当的支架来将电机座和中央枢纽夹紧到机架臂管上。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:668
#: 2eab2696b0b445408a9afd7c84110b66
msgid ""
"Tubing needs to be clamped but must not be \"crushed\", silicone or rubber "
"gasket can provide protection and vibration isolation."
msgstr "管材需要夹紧但不能\"压扁\"，硅胶或橡胶垫片可以提供保护和隔震。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:670
#: a4aa981aa0014286a86f404ecae75437
msgid ""
"Hardware should be aluminum or stainless steel machine screws and you can "
"use Nylok nuts or \"Blue\" Loctite on regular nuts."
msgstr "五金件应使用铝制或不锈钢机螺钉，可以使用尼龙锁紧螺母或在普通螺母上涂\"蓝色\"螺纹锁固剂。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:672
#: c4884b9caa1b4f73b19d747019f58ae5
msgid ""
"Plate separation and mounting can be provided with Nylon or aluminum "
"standoffs."
msgstr "板材间距和安装可以用尼龙或铝制支撑柱实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:674
#: e9ff100a126746309ae3cfcc5df656b9
msgid ""
"(Note: It would be really nice if somebody made an X internal slip-glue fit "
"ferrule for the center of the frame tubes but they don't - yet!)"
msgstr "（注意：如果有人能为机架管中心制作X型内部滑动粘合套管就太好了，但目前还没有——还没有！）"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:678
#: 12d02143a869477a975e03afd127c4ea
msgid ""
"There are a wide variety of Carbon fiber and epoxy fiberglass components to "
"choose from."
msgstr "可供选择的碳纤维和环氧玻璃纤维产品种类繁多。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:681
#: 8ee84ad38fea41c98be7cb4aafd87d62
msgid ""
"Carbon fiber products are available from \\ `RockWest Composites "
"<https://www.rockwestcomposites.com/>`__ and `Carbon Fiber Tube Shop "
"<http://www.carbonfibertubeshop.com>`__\\ and \\ `Dragon Plate "
"<https://dragonplate.com/>`__"
msgstr ""
"碳纤维产品可从 `RockWest Composites <https://www.rockwestcomposites.com/>`__ 和 "
"`Carbon Fiber Tube Shop <http://www.carbonfibertubeshop.com>`__\\ 以及 \\ "
"`Dragon Plate <https://dragonplate.com/>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:682
#: 341fa8f5c49c41698880bfa828c9e200
