msgstr "具体制作示例与技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:795
#: 3de3a5fb6cd34c6da23440a321302e0c
msgid ""
"Some design considerations for a medium large, high efficiency, heavy lift "
"Quadcopter build."
msgstr "中大型、高效率、大载重四轴飞行器的一些设计考虑。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:798
#: 303fcf440847400abf08b577a41b85b1
msgid ""
"A simple, rugged and very versatile X Quadcopter with a frame sized large "
"enough to accept 18\" diameter propellers might include:"
msgstr "一款简单、坚固、用途广泛的X型四轴飞行器，机架尺寸足以容纳18英寸直径螺旋桨，可能包括："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:801
#: 10d102632d0b4350b41523158b4a4c1a
msgid ""
"High quality 20mm carbon fiber tube frame arms with SteadiDrone motor mounts"
" and central frame tube clamps from EBay or China."
msgstr "高质量20mm碳纤维管机架臂，配SteadiDrone电机座和从eBay或中国购买的中央机架管夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:803
#: c2eb569d82cd47f7949e92b3fd9697d8
msgid ""
"Cut and drilled carbon fiber or fiberglass top and bottom central frame "
"plates mounted to the tube clamps and standoffs."
msgstr "切割和钻孔的碳纤维或玻璃纤维顶部和底部中央机架板，安装到管夹和支撑柱上。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:805
#: 550d3bd63f1745db90b720070bab2f49
msgid "A custom or commercial off the shelf landing gear system."
msgstr "定制或现成的起落架系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:806
#: af1728e369e644b5b4d0c33a0c19578b
msgid ""
"An optimal Pro configuration might include the top rated $120.00 KDE "
"4014XF-380KF motors and a 30 amp 3 - 6 cell  four in one ESC."
msgstr "最优专业配置可能包括顶级的120美元KDE 4014XF-380KF电机和30安培3-6节四合一ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:810
#: 2a80e069573744cdb1e30a48fd274fe9
msgid ""
"The motors and ESC would cost about $540.00 and you would get a copter "
"tuneable to lift up to 20+ pounds in total weight."
msgstr "电机和ESC的费用约为540美元，您将获得一架可调参到总重20磅以上起飞能力的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:812
#: 8c78db1ddeda4b6da6519432d05645a3
msgid ""
"It is reasonable to get this configuration to achieve usable 60 minute "
"flight times even with photo or video equipment aboard."
msgstr "即使搭载照片或视频设备，实现可用的60分钟飞行时间也是合理的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:815
#: b1bb7ac8e3004c91842a17302c5b7e63
msgid ""
"A more conservative hobby configuration might include the $40.00 SunnySky "
"X4108S 380KV motors and a 25 amp four in one ESC."
msgstr "更保守的业余配置可能包括40美元的SunnySky X4108S 380KV电机和25安培四合一ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:818
#: d9ae161cc02a4d0db139fd4f64b02081
msgid ""
"The motors and ESC would cost about $200.00 and you would get a copter "
"tuneable to lift up to 10+ pounds in total weight."
msgstr "电机和ESC费用约为200美元，您将获得一架可调参到总重10磅以上起飞能力的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:820
#: 906235e52d874913b216d70a239b668f
msgid ""
"Even with this setup you could achieve usable flight times in excess of 30 "
"minutes with small to medium consumer size cameras."
msgstr "即使是这种配置，搭载小到中型消费级相机也可以实现超过30分钟的可用飞行时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:824
#: 0363aed0600c48f8a5684db35b8f0b93
msgid "Some additional features that need to be considered are:"
msgstr "需要考虑的一些附加功能："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:826
#: 6e5b672eb7ac4fb9a87c9ae021b287f0
msgid ""
"A third frame plate under the two frame tube sandwiching plates can "
"accommodate the batteries, ESCs and Receiver."
msgstr "在两块机架管夹板下方的第三块机架板可以容纳电池、ESC和接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:828
#: 9aea842422624f428ed9082206f27bbc
msgid ""
"A vacuum formed, fabricated or adapted top and bottom shell can weatherproof"
" the copter and increase its resistance to mishaps."
msgstr "真空成型、自制或改装的顶部和底部外壳可以使飞行器防风雨，并增加其抗意外损伤的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:830
#: 4aab267343544363aa741036d48df6ba
msgid ""
"This frame is less than 27\" from corner to corner, but props can be removed"
" for transport or folding arms could be incorporated."
msgstr "这个机架角对角不足27英寸，但可以拆卸螺旋桨以便运输，或可以集成可折叠机臂。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:832
#: 4e96834d22ca4838812685f02f83c728
msgid ""
"This frame will be very light and strong and it will allow lots of latitude "
"in how it is set up and it will be easy to upgrade."
msgstr "这个机架将非常轻便坚固，在设置方式上有很大的灵活性，且易于升级。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:834
#: 4701b8c6a28044c2adcd9969539afb15
msgid ""
"Its ability to accept larger props even with an inexpensive power system "
"will provide much better than average flight times."
msgstr "即使使用廉价动力系统，其接受更大螺旋桨的能力也将提供远超平均水平的飞行时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:837
#: 450c089d9a1147bc882bcc1bf95a9e1c
msgid ""
"The copters capabilities will be according to the power system selected, the"
" battery combination used and the total weight."
msgstr "飞行器的能力取决于所选的动力系统、使用的电池组合以及总重量。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:839
#: 7dae46cf073d4ce49d7d012ba8a32df7
msgid ""
"You can include a camera gimbal under the center plate, make sure the "
"landing gear does not interfere with the cameras view."
msgstr "您可以在中央板下方安装相机云台，确保起落架不会干扰相机视野。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:841
#: 42ddcef3dba74fb4841e4cc0be99a527
msgid ""
"The landing gear should minimize interference with prop wash and provide "
"strong, resilient and stable support."
msgstr "起落架应尽量减少对桨洗的干扰，并提供强劲、有弹性且稳定的支撑。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:843
#: a80a68e9b8c84dd688a1778feedf96c0
msgid ""
"If you really are determined to build your own frame, this is a really good "
"place to start."
msgstr "如果您真的决心自制机架，这是一个很好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:849
#: d85e3e4cee20494289ee4840a067314d
msgid ""
"The above design is a very capable pro-grade Quadcopter with an "
"exceptionally wide performance and endurance envelope."
msgstr "上述设计是一款性能卓越的专业级四轴飞行器，具有极宽的性能和续航包线。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:853
#: e9fa558df9d5489580c7f8d1c769c3e1
msgid "A Small Quadcopter Optimised to Use High Efficiency Lithium Batteries"
msgstr "针对高效锂电池优化的小型四轴飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:855
#: 93163de046ff46d2afbda57c62beba34
msgid ""
"Modern ultra efficient Lithium batteries can have nearly twice the energy "
"per unit weight of the LiPo batteries we normally use."
msgstr "现代超高效锂电池的单位重量能量几乎是我们通常使用的LiPo电池的两倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:857
#: afd87dc605f04d0c8de356055e778932
msgid ""
"3300 mah 3.7volt Panasonic NCR18650B batteries weigh 47 grams versus a "
"normal LiPo equivalent of about 100 grams per cell."
msgstr "3300毫安时3.7伏松下NCR18650B电池重47克，而同等容量的普通LiPo电池每节约100克。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:859
#: 8ad0fa74a5d14bcfb2f695a49233e569
msgid ""
"Their disadvantage is that their maximum discharge rate is only 2C so 6.6 "
"Amps."
msgstr "其缺点是最大放电倍率仅为2C，即6.6安培。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:861
#: 9d92865504e142979aaf8c9175a765fd
msgid ""
"They will also last for many times the number of charge discharge cycles of "
"our normal LiPos."
msgstr "它们的充放电循环次数也远多于我们普通的LiPo电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:863
#: d8f9ba204b704cdab459a6742fb30db0
msgid ""
"Used properly a copter using these batteries can get nearly twice the flight"
" time of one with the same weight of LiPo batteries."
msgstr "正确使用时，使用这些电池的飞行器可以获得近乎同重量LiPo电池飞行时间的两倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:865
#: 129179d8b4b248eb823ed71221ddd402
msgid ""
"The most important factor in designing a copter to use these batteries is to"
" keep the weight low enough that their is sufficient current."
msgstr "设计使用这些电池的飞行器时最重要的因素是将重量控制在足够低，以保证有足够的电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:868
#: ebed1ffe1dc6435b9c5eac507dcb619c
msgid ""
"This quadcopter design uses carefully selected T-Motor MT2206 1200 KV 30 "
"gram motors and 10\" props with a light carbon fiber frame."
msgstr "该四轴飞行器设计选用了T-Motor MT2206 1200KV 30克电机和10英寸螺旋桨，配轻量碳纤维机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:870
#: 7d380737af994ca5acb08ad576854a53
msgid ""
"It includes a 2S 2P 6600mah lithium battery, autopilot, receiver and even an"
" FPV camera and transmitter."
msgstr "包含一块2S 2P 6600毫安时锂电池、飞控、接收机，甚至FPV摄像头和图传。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:872
#: 6b4d1c87055b44d9b5c393cf5cea3e49
msgid ""
"It weighs about a pound and since the battery is 2 parallel it can provide "
"13.2 amps of current (max current is less than 10 amps.)"
msgstr "重量约一磅，由于电池是两并联，可提供13.2安培电流（最大电流不到10安培）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:874
#: c034566c5ccc4d0795c79f82f81e3a0a
msgid ""
"`Xcalc computations <http://www.ecalc.ch/xcoptercalc.php?ecalc>`__ show that"
" a hover time of 60 minutes might be possible with a realistic fly around "
"time of about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"`Xcalc计算 <http://www.ecalc.ch/xcoptercalc.php?ecalc>`__ "
"显示悬停时间可能达到60分钟，实际绕飞时间约30分钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:881
#: 56e4e9c1786f4f0bbac50ba53fb0fc8e
msgid ""
"This is an easy to build example of a practical and rugged design with "
"exceptional capabilities and double the normal flight time."
msgstr "这是一个易于制作的实用坚固设计示例，具有卓越的性能和正常飞行时间的两倍续航。"

